          %h3#settheoretic_principle_of_unique_choice Set-theoretic principle of unique choice
          %p
            In
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dependent+type+theory"} dependent type theory
            with
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/power+sets"} power sets
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/set-theoretic+principle+of+unique+choice"} set-theoretic principle of unique choice
            is given by the following rule:
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
